        <body>
            <div xml:id="d779">

                <pb facs="0937" n="843" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg843"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lee to Mr. Rockhill.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Consulate-General</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-12-30"><hi rendition="#italic">December 30, 1896</hi></date>.
                        (Received January 2, 1897.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 275.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to the trial of Julio
                    Sanguily, reported by Mr. Springer in dispatch No. 271, of the 24th instant, I
                    have to confirm my telegram of the 28th instant, as follows: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Assistant Secretary of State,
                                Washington:</hi></p>
                        <p>Sanguily sentenced life imprisonment. Appeal to be taken.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lee.</hi></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fitzhugh Lee</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Consul-General.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
